### 用自己的账号填写变量，不要提交真实密码或token。
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@token = 替换为登录响应中的token
@book = 1
@order = 1

### 进程与数据库就绪
GET {{base}}/api/ready

### 登录
POST {{base}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"你的姓名","password":"你的学号"}

### 书名或课程搜索
GET {{base}}/api/books?keyword=Go

### 发布教材，价格单位分
POST {{base}}/api/books
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Go程序设计","course":"程序设计","category":"计算机","condition":"九成新","price":1999,"description":"少量笔记","contact":"测试联系方式"}

### 下单
POST {{base}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"book_id":{{book}}}

### 付款地址
POST {{base}}/api/orders/{{order}}/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 主动查单
POST {{base}}/api/orders/{{order}}/sync
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 取消
POST {{base}}/api/orders/{{order}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 确认收货
POST {{base}}/api/orders/{{order}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}
